sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Leader A
    box rgb(237, 246, 252) Inside Leader B
        participant B as Replay and block producer
        participant P as Vote and certificate Pool
    end
    participant V as Other validators

    A->>B: Block 103 data
    A->>V: Block 103 data
    B->>B: Execute 103; use it as expected parent
    B->>V: BlockHeader for 104, parent 103
    B->>V: Early transaction data for 104

    Note over P,V: Parent votes and early block production overlap
    V->>P: Parent votes or valid certificates
    P->>P: Check parent and intervening skip certificates
    P-->>B: Local ready-parent notification

    alt Ready parent is block 103
        B->>B: Keep the early work
    else Ready parent is a different block Q
        B->>B: Stop old record input
        B->>V: UpdateParent naming Q
        B->>B: Rebuild execution on Q
        V->>V: Discard old execution effects; use Q
    end

    B->>V: Remaining block 104 data and footer
    V->>V: Complete execution; check own voting conditions
    V->>P: Ordinary notar votes for completed block 104
    B->>V: Produce subsequent blocks 105 to 107
